# Global leaderboards (optional). Without these the game uses on-device leaderboards.
# 1. Create a Firebase project → add a Web app → copy the API key and project ID.
# 2. Authentication → Sign-in method → enable "Anonymous".
# 3. Firestore Database → create (production mode) → deploy firestore.rules.
# 4. Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the values, then restart `npm run dev`.
VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
